["银川至吴忠一段兼供银兰和银西两条客运通道使用。吴忠以南，前往中卫与前往庆阳、西安的列车分道运行。","秦王川以西，列车经树屏接入兰州至中川机场城际铁路，使用既有枢纽径路进入兰州西。"],"grade":null,"historical":false,"history":["2016年国家发展改革委批复中卫至兰州铁路可行性研究报告。","2019年12月29日，银川至中卫段开通。","2022年12月29日，中卫至兰州段开通，银川至兰州高铁贯通。"],"id":"hs-yinlan","intro":"由银川沿宁夏平原至吴忠后，线路转向中卫，跨入甘肃白银市，再由秦王川向兰州枢纽接入中川铁路，抵达兰州西。中卫南是先期开通段和后期开通段的衔接处。","junctions":[{"coordinate":[103.644805,36.42038],"hubId":"hub-lanzhou","id":"jct-dingjiagou","name":"定家沟线路所"},{"coordinate":[103.5919857,36.3716432],"hubId":"hub-lanzhou","id":"jct-shuping","name":"树屏线路所"}],"lengthKm":431,"lengthScope":"宁夏回族自治区全线通车公告的正线工程口径：银中段212公里，中兰段219公里，合计431公里。","name":"银兰高速铁路","networkNames":["京兰通道"],"notes":"","opened":"2019-12-29 银中段；2022-12-29 全线贯通","openingDate":"2022-12-29","operatingSpeed":null,"parameterRef":{"document":"204db3ae8934d480209d"},"photos":[{"author":"Tianzetong121","caption":"银兰高铁沿线的中卫南站。","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","src":"assets/photos/v8-zhongweinan.webp","title":"Zhongweinan_Railway_Station_In_Sunset.jpg","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhongweinan_Railway_Station_In_Sunset.jpg"},{"author":"Joey0501","caption":"银兰高铁沿线的白银南站。","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","src":"assets/photos/v8-baiyinnan.webp","title":"白银南站.jpg","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%99%BD%E9%93%B6%E5%8D%97%E7%AB%99.jpg"},{"author":"N509FZ","caption":"2017年10月的银川站，银兰和银西两条客运通道均从这里出发。","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","src":"assets/photos/hs-yinxi-station.webp","title":"Yinchuan Railway Station (20171006104644).jpg","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yinchuan_Railway_Station_(20171006104644).jpg"}],"provinces":["宁夏","甘肃"],"quality":"已核实","regions":["西北"],"role":"trunk","scope":"取银川至兰州西通达口径。将银中段与中兰段通车站表按中卫南去重，列13个站名，含借道中川铁路抵达的兰州西。2022年自治区通稿另列全线12座客运车站。","sectionRefs":[{"direction":"forward","id":"hs-yinxi-yinwu"},{"direction":"